The extension adds generic configured-accelerometer backends, supervised
calibration/test/chart/accuracy workflows, independent saved models, an
isolated beta calibration experiment, and transactional installation with
native Moonraker updates. The original Beacon algorithm is credited to
CloakedWayne; this extension does not claim upstream endorsement. Historical
reports and synthetic tests do not certify present hardware behavior.

